{"id":"granicus-1-1607","platform":"granicus","body":"City Council","name":"Special City Council Meeting","date":"2021-09-08","time":"","canceled":false,"agenda_url":"https://pvestates.granicus.com/AgendaViewer.php?view_id=1&clip_id=1607","minutes_url":"https://pvestates.granicus.com/MinutesViewer.php?view_id=1&clip_id=1607&doc_id=fe8f5325-2626-11ec-88a7-0050569183fa","packet_url":"","clip_id":1607,"view_id":1,"video_url":"https://pvestates.granicus.com/MediaPlayer.php?view_id=1&clip_id=1607","transcript_url":"","mp4_url":"","mp3_url":"","agenda_text":"September 8, 2021\n8:00\nAM\nCouncil Chambers of City Hall\n340 Palos Verdes Drive West\nPalos Verdes Estates, CA 90274\nAGENDA\nOF A REGULAR MEETING\nOF THE CITY COUNCIL OF THE CITY OF\nPALOS VERDES ESTATES, CALIFORNIA 90274\nCopies of the staff reports or other written documentation relating to each item of business referred to on the agenda are on file in the office of the City Clerk and are available for public inspection. If applicable, materials related to an item on this agenda submitted to the Council after distribution of the agenda packet are available for public inspection in the City Clerk's office during normal business hours. Any person having any question concerning any agenda item may call the City Clerk to make inquiry concerning the item. Upon request, the agenda and documents in the agenda packet can be made available in appropriate alternative formats to persons with a disability in compliance with the Americans with Disabilities Act. Please contact the City Clerk at 310-378-0383, at least 48 hours prior to the meeting to request a disability-related modification or accommodation.\nThe City Council welcomes and encourages public participation at the Council meetings; however, to allow for the orderly progression of business, each person wishing to comment or make a presentation shall be limited to up to three (3) minutes. Anyone wishing to address the City Council is requested to fill out a green speaker's card available at the entry of the meeting room. The card permits the City to identify persons for purposes of City Council minute preparation. Please see specific agenda sections below for any other requirements related to meeting participation. The City Council, at the direction of the Mayor with concurrence of the Council, may modify the order of items shown on the agenda.\nCALL AND NOTICE OF SPECIAL MEETING\nTo the Members of the City Council of the City of Palos Verdes Estates:\nNOTICE IS HEREBY GIVEN that the Mayor has called a special meeting of the City Council to be conducted through video conference in compliance with the Governor's and LA County Health Official's emergency orders. The meeting will be called to order at 5:00 p.m. on Wednesday, September 8, 2021. The agenda for the special meeting with the items of business to be transacted or discussed is set forth below along with instructions on how to attend the public meeting.\nPosted by the Office of the City Clerk on Friday, September 3, 2021 at 5:00 p.m.\nHOW TO VIEW THE MEETING: No physical location from which members of the public may observe the meeting and offer public comment will be provided. The meeting will not be livestreamed. You may attend the meeting through a computer or telephone:\nJOIN BY COMPUTER: https://us02web.zoom.us/j/84118505913\nZOOM ID: 841 1850 5913\nJOIN BY TELEPHONE: Call (669) 900-9128 and enter Zoom ID 84118505913#\nHOW TO PARTICIPATE BEFORE THE MEETING: Please submit your comments in writing to CityCouncilMeeting@pvestates.org. Comments received by NOON on Tuesday September 7, 2021 will be included with the posted agenda. Additional comments received by NOON on Wednesday, September 8, 2021 will be forwarded to the Councilmembers and posted online as late correspondence. Further additional comments received before the start of the meeting will be forwarded to the Councilmembers at the start of the meeting.\nHOW TO PARTICIPATE DURING THE MEETING: If you would like to address the City Council during the meeting, please email CityCouncilMeeting@pvestates.org with the phone number and/or Zoom display name from which you will be calling in to the meeting before the meeting begins. Alternatively, you may utilize the \"Raise Hand\" feature during the public comment period of the meeting.\nCALL TO ORDER\nROLL CALL\nCOMMUNICATIONS FROM THE PUBLIC\nThis portion of the agenda is reserved for comments from the public on items which are NOT on the agenda. Due to state law, no action can be taken by the Council this evening on matters presented under this section. If the Council determines action is warranted, the item may be referred to staff or placed on a future Council agenda.\nNEW BUSINESS\n1.\nREVIEW OF THE 2021-2029 HOUSING ELEMENT DRAFT The draft document is posted on the City’s website at:\nhttps://www.pvestates.org/services/planning/2021-update\nCorrespondence\nStaff Report\nLate Correspondence\nADJOURNMENT","minutes_text":"PK\u0003\u0004\u0014\u0000\u0006\u0000\b\u0000\u0000\u0000!\u0000qr�\\�\u0001\u0000\u0000e\u0007\u0000\u0000\u0013\u0000\b\u0002[Content_Types].xml �\u0004\u0002(�\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\